  "response": "## Analyse\n\nJe dois créer `tests/test_summarize.py` avec 4 tests couvrant les cas limites : texte vide, texte court, texte long, et max_sentences=1. Les learnings critiques montrent que je dois vérifier la complétude du fichier et valider en trois étapes (syntaxe → collection → exécution).\n\n```python path: tests/test_summarize.py\nimport pytest\nfrom tools.summarize import summarize, split_sentences, score_sentence\n\n\nclass TestSplitSentences:\n    \"\"\"Test sentence splitting utility.\"\"\"\n    \n    def test_empty_text(self):\n        \"\"\"Empty text returns empty list.\"\"\"\n        result = split_sentences(\"\")\n        assert result == []\n    \n    def test_single_sentence(self):\n        \"\"\"Single sentence is returned as list with one element.\"\"\"\n        result = split_sentences(\"Hello world.\")\n        assert len(result) == 1\n        assert result[0] == \"Hello world.\"\n\n\nclass TestScoreSentence:\n    \"\"\"Test sentence scoring utility.\"\"\"\n    \n    def test_score_non_empty(self):\n        \"\"\"Non-empty sentence returns positive score.\"\"\"\n        score = score_sentence(\"This is a test sentence.\")\n        assert isinstance(score, (int, float))\n        assert score >= 0\n\n\nclass TestSummarize:\n    \"\"\"Test main summarize function.\"\"\"\n    \n    def test_empty_text(self):\n        \"\"\"Empty text returns empty string.\"\"\"\n        result = summarize(\"\", max_sentences=3)\n        assert result == \"\"\n    \n    def test_short_text_below_max(self):\n        \"\"\"Text with fewer sentences than max_sentences returns full text.\"\"\"\n        text = \"First sentence. Second sentence.\"\n        result = summarize(text, max_sentences=5)\n        assert result == text\n    \n    def test_long_text_truncated(self):\n        \"\"\"Text with more sentences than max_sentences is truncated.\"\"\"\n        text = \"Sentence one. Sentence two. Sentence three. Sentence four. Sentence five.\"\n        result = summarize(text, max_sentences=2)\n        sentences = split_sentences(result)\n        assert len(sentences) <= 2\n    \n    def test_max_sentences_one(self):\n        \"\"\"max_sentences=1 returns single sentence.\"\"\"\n        text = \"First sentence. Second sentence. Third sentence.\"\n        result = summarize(text, max_sentences=1)\n        sentences = split_sentences(result)\n        assert len(sentences) == 1\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n```bash\ncd . && python -m pytest tests/test_summarize.py -v --tb=short\n```",
